The corpus includes, among other surfaces, philosophical texts, documentation, genealogy, analyses, audits, cultural works, specifications, structured data and code or prototypes. Different pieces may require different legal regimes. Where a file or subdirectory contains a specific licence, that licence governs that piece within its stated scope.

