- clone or fork the repository only to the extent necessary to study the project, test changes and prepare a contribution back through an Issue or Pull Request;
- modify a copy only for that review/contribution purpose or under additional permission from the relevant rights holder.

Unless specifically authorised or independently permitted by law, this limited permission does NOT grant:

- commercial exploitation of the corpus or its works;
